Prague's Spell Garden includes a derived subset of the Marble Skill Taxonomy (v1).

Marble Skill Taxonomy (v1) · © Generative Spark, Inc. (Marble) · https://withmarble.com · ODbL 1.0 (database) and CC BY-SA 4.0 (content)

Included from https://github.com/withmarbleapp/os-taxonomy (tag v1):

- Mathematics topics (id, type, subject, domain, name, description, age range, centrality, evidence, assessment prompt)
- Dependencies between those mathematics topics (hard and soft, with reasons)
- Cluster summaries for mathematics domains

Standards codes and topics outside mathematics are not included. Dependencies that point at a non-mathematics prerequisite were dropped so this maths-only app cannot stay locked on another subject.

